cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "saecolmig-sim: design-based simulation of small area estimators of migration for Colombian municipalities"
abstract: >-
  R code for a design-based simulation that draws ECV 2024-style samples from
  the CNPV 2018 census frame, fits area-level and sub-area small area
  estimators of six migration outcomes for the 1,122 municipalities of
  Colombia, and scores their point estimates and reported uncertainty against
  the census values.
